,"repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2025-04-01T18:47:36Z","updated_at":"2025-06-03T00:06:59Z","closed_at":"2025-06-02T23:59:37Z","assignee":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.4\n\n### System information\n\nOS indpendent\n\n### Issue description\n\nconcerned API points as exposed to the user\n* https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_displayserver.html#class-displayserver-method-window-get-current-screen\n* https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_window.html#class-window-property-current-screen\n\nnot making a PR (yet) in case another approach is preferred\n\n## Current state: return values per OS/driver\n\nNOTE: points of concern have been highlighted in **bold**.\n\nmacos\n* -1 for invalid window ID\n* 0 if screen was not found\n\nlinux wayland\n* always 0, as not supported, and **this is not documented** (well, it's kinda hinted at with the note on the constant `SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW`: \"Note: On Linux (Wayland), this constant always represents the screen at index 0.\", but it should really be part of this func's description)\n* _window_set_current_screen_ not implemented/supported, and **this is not documented**\n\nlinux x11\n* 0 for invalid window ID\n  * **macos and windows return -1**\n* 0, if single monitor\n* 0, if screen not found\n\n\nwindows\n* -1 for invalid window ID\n* 0, if screen not found\n\n\nandroid and ios\n* always SCREEN_OF_MAIN_WINDOW, as not supported\n  * **this constant represents `-1`, other OS/driver would return `0` in this case**\n* _window_set_current_screen_ not implemented/supported, and **this is not documented**\n\nweb\n* always 1\n  * **other OS/driver would return `0` in this case**\n* _window_set_current_screen_ not implemented/supported, and **this is not documented**\n\n\nsummary of return values\n* `-1`: given window id is invalid\n  * when compared to desktop OS, this is \"misused\" by android and ios\n* `0`: if only 1 monitor exists, or fallback value if some OS/driver-dependent func call fails\n  * when compared to windows and macos, this is \"misused\" by linux x11\n\n\n## recommended changes\n\n* android and ios\n  * always return `0`\n* linux x11\n  * return `-1` for invalid window ID\n* web\n  * always return `0`\n* document in DisplayDriver and Window (in latter, only a link to DisplayDriver for more info)\n  * the OS/drivers where `window_get_current_screen` is not supported: linux wayland, android, ios, web\n    * and that `-1` represents an invalid value\n  * the OS/drivers where `window_set_current_screen` is not supported: linux wayland, android, ios, web\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n/\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n/","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104891/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}